# Mirrors .gitignore, EXCEPT data/psychochat.sqlite is deliberately NOT
# listed here: Vercel has no persistent writable filesystem, so this file
# has to ship as part of the deployment (see next.config.mjs /
# outputFileTracingIncludes and lib/db.mjs). Keeping it out of .gitignore
# instead would put it back in the public git history — this file (read
# directly from the local disk by `vercel --prod`, independent of git)
# is how it stays local-only while still reaching the deployed site.
/node_modules
/.next/
/out/
/build
.DS_Store
*.pem
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.env
.env*.local
*.tsbuildinfo
/data/mock-scores.json
/data/history/
/data/logs/
.vercel
img/
